The Developer Knowledge Graph goes one step further by understanding **how every part of the project is connected**.

Instead of treating files as isolated documents, the AI receives a graph of relationships between modules, classes, services, controllers, database models, APIs, imports, and dependencies.

This significantly improves the AI's ability to reason about architecture, understand code flow, perform impact analysis, and generate context-aware code.

